### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "sevara",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "user"
}

### Register seller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "seller1",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "seller"
}


### Login seller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "seller1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}


### Protected test
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### Seller role test
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/test
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create product (seller)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Наушники",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 150000,
  "stock": 10
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 140000,
  "status": "hidden"
}

###

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

GET http://localhost:8080/health
### Login as user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "sevara",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("user_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}
###

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/test
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### Список товаров, без фильтров
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### Поиск по названию + диапазон цены + пагинация
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?q=Наушники&price_min=100000&price_max=1000000&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

###

### Фильтр по категории
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?category=electronics
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

###

### Невалидный диапазон цены — ждём 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?price_min=1000&price_max=100
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

###

### Деталь товара
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

###

### Несуществующий товар — ждём 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

###


### ==================== A-02: Оформление заказа ====================

### Успешный заказ — ждём 201, total = 450000 * 2 = 900000
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("order_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Проверка: stock у товара 1 должен уменьшиться на 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

###

### Не хватает stock — ждём 409, сток НЕ должен измениться
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 9999 }
  ]
}

###

### Пустой список позиций — ждём 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": []
}

###

### Несуществующий товар в позиции — ждём 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 999999, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

###

### Без токена вообще — ждём 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

###

### ==================== B-02: Seller управление заказами ====================

### Login seller заново (получаем seller token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "seller1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("seller_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Тестовый товар",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 50000,
  "stock": 10
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"login": "sevara",
"password": "password123"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"items":[
{
"product_id":2,
"quantity":1
}
]
}

### Seller смотрит свои заказы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


###

### Seller получает детали заказа
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


###

### Seller отправляет заказ (ship)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


###

### Проверка: заказ должен быть shipped
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}

### Повторная отправка уже shipped заказа — ждём 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}